@baseUrl = http://localhost:5105
@teacherToken = replace-with-teacher-access-token
@studentToken = replace-with-student-access-token
@classId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@invitationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Existing public self-registration (then sign in)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"new-student","password":"Student.Password123!"}

### Teacher invites an existing independent participant by exact login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/invitations
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"new-student"}

### Teacher reads invitations and decisions for their own class
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/classes/{{classId}}/invitations?offset=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### Student reads their invitations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/class-invitations?offset=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Student accepts (use accept:false to decline)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/class-invitations/{{invitationId}}/response
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accept":true}

### Nonexistent or another student's invitation returns 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/class-invitations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/response
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"accept":true}
